  "description_short": "Vibrant George coffee shop serving speciality brews, fresh pastries, and wholesome breakfast and lunch fare.",
  "description_long": "Poco.loco has carved out a loyal following in George's city centre with its commitment to quality coffee and unpretentious, wholesome food. The cafe's bright, welcoming interior and friendly service make it a popular spot for locals meeting over morning cappuccinos or settling in with laptops for a working lunch.\n\nThe menu runs from hearty breakfasts and fresh salads to generously filled sandwiches and daily specials that change with the seasons. Their house-roasted coffee is consistently excellent, and the pastry counter tempts with croissants, muffins, and sweet treats that pair perfectly with an afternoon pick-me-up. Located on York Street in the heart of George Central, it's an easy stop whether you're running errands in town or taking a break from exploring the Garden Route.",
